      "id": "claim_fb1aaf1539844ad0990c2b9e88315c83",
      "statement": "ForceOrg-40k's canonical deployment is a single self-hosted Docker Compose host containing web, API, PostgreSQL 16 and S3-compatible storage; no managed backend, hosted database or third-party storage service is involved, and the instance's own HTTP API is the only integration surface for external systems.",
