      "id": "claim_4ea57ca8e1004159a29772935fd4b505",
      "statement": "The browser calls the API directly rather than through a Next.js server proxy: apps/web/src/lib/api.ts builds requests from NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL (default http://localhost:4000/api), a value Next inlines at build time, so repointing an already-built web image at a different API origin requires a rebuild.",
