      "id": "claim_ae5a7683ddf4487a876467c82ec5030f",
      "statement": "The API is the only process that talks to S3; its storage service resolves S3_ENDPOINT falling back to AWS_ENDPOINT and enables forcePathStyle whenever a custom endpoint is set, which is what makes local SeaweedFS a drop-in replacement for real S3.",
