      "statement": "The sync worker is the only writer in the topology that bypasses the HTTP API: the ETL pipeline instantiates PrismaClient from @forceorg/db-client and writes Wahapedia catalog data and SyncMetadata directly to Postgres, which the API only reads back (e.g. via /api/changelog).",
