    {
      "id": "claim_0bf9ed126ae145bda47025c696a90121",
      "statement": "docker-compose.yml and docker-compose.prod.yml declare the same five services — postgres (5432 + pg_isready healthcheck, dev-published), seaweedfs s3 (9000 S3 / 9333 master, dev-published; prod pins chrislusf/seaweedfs:3.80 and publishes nothing), api (4000), web (3000) and a profile-gated one-shot sync-worker — differing only in delivery: local source build versus pulling published GHCR images, including a published forceorg-sync-worker image run with `docker compose run --rm`.",
