      "statement": "docker-compose.prod.yml pulls ghcr.io/fatpat81/beerhammer/forceorg-{api,web,sync-worker}:${FORCEORG_TAG:-latest} and publishes only the API and web ports (${API_PORT:-4000}, ${WEB_PORT:-3000}); unset variables fall back to placeholder credentials that are public in the repository (${JWT_SECRET:-please-change-me}, postgres/postgrespassword) so test and CI hosts boot with zero configuration, and docs/DEPLOYMENT.md §2/§3.1 require overriding them before any exposure beyond localhost since anyone can otherwise mint valid write tokens. Rollback is re-pulling with FORCEORG_TAG=<previous sha>.",
